session Voblint_CFG in "." = "Voblint_IMP2" +
  description "Procedure-aware CFG: core, trace, collecting, and structural compiler"
  directories
    "Collecting"
    "Compiler"
  theories
    CFG_Def
    CFG_Local_Trace
    LTR_Collect
    LTR_Abstract
    IMP2_Proc_to_CFG
    CFG_Transfer
    Compile_Invariants
    Control_Residual
    Located_Exec
    Control_Simulation
    Control_Simulation_Regression
  (* Stage 5B+: re-add each theory here as it is migrated onto the two-relation
     procedure-aware CFG (analysis/solver). They still reference the retired
     single-edge-set representation and are not built yet:
       CFG_Prune Compiler/Located_LTR
     CFG_Path (nat-offset path infrastructure) was retired in Stage 3; the
     procedure-aware compiler allocates cfg_node Statement indices directly, so no
     separate offset layer is needed.  CFG_Transfer was migrated: its edge_step /
     combine_collect / call_enter_store moved into the core (CFG_Def,
     CFG_Local_Trace) and its whole-path edges_collect / offset_path fold is
     superseded by the located csim simulation; only edge_collect remains. *)
